<%# A student's lifecycle actions, in the page header.

    **No "Edit".** The record's page edits in place, so a control that navigates to the page you are on
    has nothing to do - the same reason it came off the teacher page.

    **Deactivate or reactivate, never both.** `Student.find` has no discard scope, so an archived student's page
    renders exactly like an active one, and it offered "Archive" - which discards an already discarded
    record and changes nothing. A control that can only report that it did nothing is not a control.

    **"View portfolio" is the one link out.** It was a `#3` tile among the money figures, styled as a
    fourth KPI; a portfolio id is not a metric, and the useful part of that tile was that it was a link.
    `PortfolioPolicy#show?` returns true for an admin, so it is a page an admin can actually open - worth
    checking before linking, since two roles here get redirected instead. %>
<% if student.portfolio.present? %>
  <%= link_to portfolio_path(student.portfolio), class: admin_secondary_button_class do %>
    <%= lucide_icon("chart-pie", class: "h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-slate-500") %>
    View portfolio
  <% end %>
<% end %>

<% if student.discarded? %>
  <%= link_to restore_admin_student_path(student),
              data: { turbo_method: :patch,
                      turbo_confirm: "Reactivate #{student.display_name}?\n\n" \
                                     "They can sign in again and reappear in the students list. " \
                                     "Their portfolio, transactions and grades are unchanged." },
              class: admin_secondary_button_class do %>
    <%= lucide_icon("rotate-ccw", class: "h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-slate-500") %>
    Reactivate
  <% end %>
<% else %>
  <%= link_to admin_student_path(student),
              data: { turbo_method: :delete,
                      turbo_confirm: "Deactivate #{student.display_name}?\n\n" \
                                     "They cannot sign in from that moment, and they leave the " \
                                     "active list. Their portfolio, transactions and grades are kept, " \
                                     "and you can reactivate the account from the students list." },
              class: admin_danger_button_class do %>
    <%= lucide_icon("user-x", class: "h-5 w-5 shrink-0") %>
    Deactivate
  <% end %>
<% end %>
